	//   • ⚠⚠ **THE "TYPE-PARAMETERIZED BY A USER DECLARATION" CLAUSE IS VACUOUS HERE, AND THAT IS A COUNT
	//     RATHER THAN A HOPE.** The clause is about a body that passes a `__ManagedMemory` around; these three
